  "goodToKnow": "Thematisieren means to bring up or address something as a topic: Der Roman thematisiert die Flucht. In daily life, it often means to raise an uncomfortable matter: Das sollten wir mal thematisieren. Books, films and speeches thematisieren things. The verb ends in -ieren, so the participle is thematisiert, with no ge-. English has no neat equivalent; address or raise comes closest."
